{"text":{"en":{"유패킹 SKY형 | [회사명] 베어링":"U-Packing SKY Type | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing SKY Type</p> <h2>유패킹 SKY형</h2> <p>피스톤·로드 겸용으로 사용하는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">U-패킹 SKY형</strong>입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing SKY Type</p> <h2>U-Packing SKY Type</h2> <p>This is the <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">U-Packing SKY type</strong>, used for both piston and rod applications.</p>","<img src=\"assets/u_packing_sky_diagram.png\" alt=\"U-Packing SKY형 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · H=높이</span></p>":"<img src=\"assets/u_packing_sky_diagram.png\" alt=\"U-Packing SKY type drawing\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Cross-section diagram<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=inner diameter · D=outer diameter · H=height</span></p>"},"ja":{"유패킹 SKY형 | [회사명] 베어링":"UパッキンSKY形 | [会社名]ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing SKY Type</p> <h2>유패킹 SKY형</h2> <p>피스톤·로드 겸용으로 사용하는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">U-패킹 SKY형</strong>입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing SKY Type</p> <h2>UパッキンSKY形</h2> <p>ピストン・ロッド兼用として使用する<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">UパッキンSKY形</strong>です。</p>","<img src=\"assets/u_packing_sky_diagram.png\" alt=\"U-Packing SKY형 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · H=높이</span></p>":"<img src=\"assets/u_packing_sky_diagram.png\" alt=\"UパッキンSKY形図面\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 断面図<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=内径・D=外径・H=高さ</span></p>"},"zh":{"유패킹 SKY형 | [회사명] 베어링":"U型密封圈 SKY型 | [公司名]轴承","<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing SKY Type</p> <h2>유패킹 SKY형</h2> <p>피스톤·로드 겸용으로 사용하는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">U-패킹 SKY형</strong>입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing SKY Type</p> <h2>U型密封圈 SKY型</h2> <p>这是可用于活塞・活塞杆两用的<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">U型密封圈 SKY型</strong>。</p>","<img src=\"assets/u_packing_sky_diagram.png\" alt=\"U-Packing SKY형 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · H=높이</span></p>":"<img src=\"assets/u_packing_sky_diagram.png\" alt=\"U型密封圈SKY型图纸\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 剖面图<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=内径・D=外径・H=高度</span></p>"}},"attrs":{"en":{"U-Packing SKY형 도면":"U-Packing SKY type drawing"},"ja":{"U-Packing SKY형 도면":"UパッキンSKY形図面"},"zh":{"U-Packing SKY형 도면":"U型密封圈SKY型图纸"}}}